---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Folio from '../components/Folio.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---
<Layout title="Reservar — Literatium" description="Reserva tu estancia en Literatium. WhatsApp +57 315 538 2112. Sin formularios, sin call centers, sin prisa.">
<Folio id="book" folioNumber="Folio X · Reservar" folioNumberEn="Folio X · Booking" dark={true}>
  <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Literatium', href: '/' }, { label: 'Reservar' }]} />

  <!-- Booking strip — most prominent CTA at the top of the folio -->
  <div class="booking-strip reveal" role="group" aria-label="Datos de reserva rápida">
    <a class="booking-strip-item is-link" href="https://wa.me/573155382112" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      <span class="bs-icon" aria-hidden="true">📱</span>
      <span>
        <span class="bs-label" data-en="WhatsApp">WhatsApp</span>
        <span class="bs-value">+57 315 538 2112</span>
      </span>
    </a>
    <span class="booking-strip-sep" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <div class="booking-strip-item">
      <span class="bs-icon" aria-hidden="true">⏱</span>
      <span>
        <span class="bs-label" data-en="Response time">Tiempo de respuesta</span>
        <span class="bs-value" data-en="Reply within hours">Respuesta en horas</span>
      </span>
    </div>
    <span class="booking-strip-sep" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <a class="booking-strip-item is-link" href="https://www.instagram.com/literatium/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      <span class="bs-icon" aria-hidden="true">🌐</span>
      <span>
        <span class="bs-label" data-en="Instagram">Instagram</span>
        <span class="bs-value">@literatium</span>
      </span>
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="reveal">
    <div class="eyebrow" style="color: var(--brass-light);" data-en="Final Chapter · The booking">Capítulo Final · La reserva</div>
    <h1 class="chapter-title on-dark">Tu próximo capítulo <em>empieza aquí</em></h1>
    <div class="fleuron" style="color: var(--brass-light);">✦ ❦ ✦</div>
  </div>

  <!-- Why book direct — 4 benefit cards above the booking-card -->
  <section class="why-direct reveal delay-1" aria-labelledby="why-direct-title">
    <div class="why-direct-eyebrow" data-en="Why book direct">Por qué reservar directo</div>
    <h2 id="why-direct-title" class="why-direct-title" data-en="The way we have always done it <em>— slowly, with calm</em>">Como lo hemos hecho siempre <em>— despacio, con calma</em></h2>
    <div class="why-direct-grid">
      <article class="why-direct-card">
        <div class="wd-icon" aria-hidden="true">📱</div>
        <h3 class="wd-title" data-en="No middlemen">Sin intermediarios</h3>
        <p class="wd-desc" data-en="Direct bookings with Martica. No commissions, no call centres.">Reservas directas con Martica. Sin comisiones, sin call centers.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="why-direct-card">
        <div class="wd-icon" aria-hidden="true">💬</div>
        <h3 class="wd-title" data-en="Personal reply">Respuesta personal</h3>
        <p class="wd-desc" data-en="Martica or someone from her team replies on WhatsApp within hours.">Martica o alguien de su equipo te responde por WhatsApp en horas.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="why-direct-card">
        <div class="wd-icon" aria-hidden="true">⏳</div>
        <h3 class="wd-title" data-en="Flexibility">Flexibilidad</h3>
        <p class="wd-desc" data-en="Date changes without penalty up to 72h before. Just ask.">Cambios de fecha sin penalización hasta 72h antes. Pregúntanos.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="why-direct-card">
        <div class="wd-icon" aria-hidden="true">☕</div>
        <h3 class="wd-title" data-en="House welcome">Bienvenida de la casa</h3>
        <p class="wd-desc" data-en="Huila coffee on arrival. Hand-drawn map. A book on your nightstand.">Café de Huila al llegar. Mapa dibujado a mano. Un libro en la mesita de noche.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="colofon-grid">
    <div class="colofon-text reveal">
      <p class="drop-cap" style="color: var(--parchment);" data-en="Message us on WhatsApp to ask about availability, rates and dates. Martica or someone from her team will answer you personally — no forms, no call centres, no rush. Here, things are done as they are done in Mompox: slowly, with calm, with heart.">Escríbenos por WhatsApp para consultar disponibilidad, tarifas y fechas. Martica o alguien de su equipo te responderá personalmente — sin formularios, sin call centers, sin prisa. Aquí las cosas se hacen como se hacen en Mompox: despacio, con calma, con el corazón.</p>
      <p style="color: var(--parchment);" data-en="For us, hosting you is not a transaction. It is the first line of a story you will write from The House of Stories. Tell us when you arrive, which room calls to you, which paths you want to walk — and we will take care of the rest.">Para nosotros, hospedarte no es una transacción. Es la primera línea de una historia que tú vas a escribir desde La Casa de las Historias. Cuéntanos cuándo llegas, qué habitación te llama, qué senderos quieres caminar — y nosotros nos encargamos del resto.</p>
      <p style="font-family: var(--font-hand); font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--brass-light); font-style: italic; margin-top: 24px;" data-en="— we wait for you in Mompox, by the river —">— te esperamos en Mompox, junto al río —</p>
      <div class="colofon-cta">
        <a href="https://wa.me/573155382112" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-primary" data-en="WhatsApp +57 315 538 2112">WhatsApp +57 315 538 2112</a>
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/literatium/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-ghost">@literatium</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="booking-card reveal delay-1">
      <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-style: italic; font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--brass-light); margin-bottom: 18px;" data-en="Book details">Datos del libro</h2>
      <div class="booking-row"><div class="icon">⌖</div><div><div class="label" data-en="Address">Dirección</div><div class="value">Calle 21 #2-47, Santa Cruz de Mompox, Bolívar, Colombia</div></div></div>
      <div class="booking-row"><div class="icon">☎</div><div><div class="label" data-en="WhatsApp">WhatsApp</div><div class="value">+57 315 538 2112</div></div></div>
      <div class="booking-row"><div class="icon">✦</div><div><div class="label" data-en="Inspiration">Inspiración</div><div class="value" data-en="The town that dreamt Macondo">El pueblo que soñó Macondo</div></div></div>
      <div class="booking-row"><div class="icon">⌘</div><div><div class="label" data-en="Heritage">Patrimonio</div><div class="value" data-en="UNESCO 1995 · Founded 1537">UNESCO 1995 · Fundación 1537</div></div></div>
      <div class="booking-row"><div class="icon">☕</div><div><div class="label" data-en="Coffee">Café</div><div class="value" data-en="From the family farm in Huila">De la finca familiar en Huila</div></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Folio>
</Layout>
